@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = change-me

### Health (no API key needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmtEntries
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get one by primary key
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmtEntries
# X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Exact-match filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmtEntries?erp_no=PSS/25/0002
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmtEntries?page=2&limit=50
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Expect 401 (missing key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmtEntries

### Expect 404 (unknown model)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nope
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Expect 400 (field not in policy.filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmtEntries?balance=100
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Expect 400 (limit above MAX_PAGE_SIZE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmtEntries?limit=100000
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
